 296: \begin{lem}
 297:   \label{lem:b}
 298:   Let $0<p\leq\frac12$, let $A$ be an $r\times c$ matrix, and let $M$ be constructed as above. Then $\nint{pM_i\one}=A_i\one$ for all $i\leq r$, and $\nint{pM_i\one}=1$ for all $i>r$.
