+
+The native objects are the finite set systems of arXiv:1611.01542.  Every
+generated Venn region is assembled from pairs {x, x XOR t}; Lemma 4.1 (the
+Reduction Lemma) therefore supplies a splitter by construction.  The answer is
+a short exact description of that splitter, not an enumeration of half of a
+2**n-element universe.
+
+This module is deterministic for (n, seed, params), uses only the standard
+library, and performs no file I/O or printing at import time.
+"""
+
