Step 0 supports a family, but only on Track B. The certificate is planted by construction, yet a construction-aware polynomial-time scan can recover it; calling this Track A would be false. I’m using the paper’s native \(p\)-splitting objects at \(p=1/d\): every universe element belongs to three sets, every listed set has \(d\) elements, and a splitter is exactly a perfect 3-uniform hypergraph matching. The hidden compact invariant is a modular arithmetic progression in the splitter labels; exhaustive detection is the honest reference algorithm.
apply patch
