codex
The generator now passes G1–G8 locally. At the initial shipping rung, random guessing hit 0/200,000, four construction-aware/greedy attacks hit 0/8 each, while the honestly disclosed Track B progression scan solved 8/8 using exactly 1,592,000 modular advances (about 0.55 seconds per instance). I’m moving to the script-owned four-vendor hardening run; its result will determine whether the family ships, escalates, or is rejected.
