title: The set splittability problem
categories: math.CO

Prior triage (a hypothesis, not ground truth - verify it against the paper):
  family: set system structures
  method: planted solution
  candidate generator: choose a subset, then generate sets with required intersection counts
  candidate verifier: count candidate intersections with each set and compare allowed sizes 


