Then we have $A_1\one=2$, $A_2\one=3$, $s=\max_iA_i\one=3$, and $q= \frac{1-p}{p} = 2$. Thus $T$ consists of the $s-1=2$ columns $\{5,6\}$, and $F$ consists of the $\ceiling{qs}-s+1=4$ columns $\{7,8,9,10\}$.

