-## Problem and construction
+## Problem and trust model
 
-This module instantiates the native definition from Bernstein, Bortner, Coskey,
-Li, and Simpson, [*The set splittability problem*](https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.01542).
-For `p = 1/d`, it gives the solver a finite collection in which every listed set
